& [DependencyCycleResolution]
  + the verifier first replays the published predecessor request packet verification A1 envelope A1 request and A1 receipt exactly
  + the verification request also carries the current authority-packet request whose A1 and all downstream descriptors must equal the published predecessor while only A2 may carry the admitted attestation descriptor
  + that current request is compiled twice byte-identically before A2 selection; raw attestation bytes and digest are checked before typed parse
  + this separates the A1-receipt-bound custody attestation from the packet descriptor that names it without trusting a producer packet or relaxing any other coordinate

